tu ec-tutu-double flex"><div class="one col-xl-6 none tutu-margins top5"><a href="https://tsmeod.top/#/register?code=ddWPwxOe" target="_blank" rel="alternate"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" class="tutu-banner" data-small="/template/dsn2/static/img/diy/1772169205small1.png" data-medium="/template/dsn2/static/img/diy/1772169205small1.png" data-large="/template/dsn2/static/img/diy/1772169205small1.png" src="" alt="imageUrl"><span class="this-adicon"></span></a></div><div class="one col-xl-6 none tutu-margins top5"><a href="https://www.akianime.cc/app-beta/" target="_blank" rel="alternate"><img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" class="tutu-banner" data-small="/template/dsn2/static/img/diy/1772169205small2.png" data-medium="/template/dsn2/static/img/diy/1772169205small2.png" data-large="/template/dsn2/static/img/diy/1772169205small2.png" src="" alt="imageUrl"><span class="this-adicon"></span></a></div></div><div class="box-width cor5"></div><div class="box-width wow fadeInUp"><div class="overflow"><div class="title flex between top40" style=""><div class="title-left"><h4 class="title-h cor4">相关作品</h4></div><div class="title-right"><a target="_blank" href="/label/map.html" class="button more">更多</a></div></div><div class="flex wrap border-box public-r hide-b-2 diy-center1 mask1"><div class="public-list-box public-pic-b"><div class="public-list-div public-list-bj"><a target="_blank" class="public-list-exp" href="/bgmdetail/4xcDDE.html" title="药屋少女的呢喃 第三季"><img class="lazy lazy1 gen-movie-img" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="data:image/gif;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVQImWNgYGBgAAAABQABh6FO1AAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="药屋少女的呢喃 第三季" data-src="/upload/vod/20261008-1/533a804bb5ff598c613daf2fcb2bd686.webp" /><span class="public-bg"></span><span class="public-prt hide" style="background: #ffdd9a;color: #4e2d03;">本季热门</span><span class="public-list-prb hide ft2">更新至6集</span><span class="public-play"><i class="fa">&#xe593;</i></span></a></div><div class="public-list-button"><a target="_blank" class="time-title hide ft4 bold" href="/bgmdetail/4xcDDE.html" title="药屋少女的呢喃 第三季">药屋少女的呢喃 第三季</a><div class="public-list-subtitle cor5 hide ft2">子の一族が起こした反乱の後始末も落ち着き、 猫猫は花街の薬師としての日常へと戻っていた。 ある日、緑青館で出された朝餉をきっかけに、猫猫はとある“違和感”を覚え、 その正体を探し始めていた。 一方、本来の身分・皇弟であることを明かし、その責務に向き合い始めた壬氏は、 楼蘭から最後に託された≪国を襲う災害の予兆≫に頭を悩ませていた。 さらにそこへ、人々を惑わす謎の仙女の噂も飛び交いはじめ、 茘国にはふたたび影が落ち始めていた。 物語の舞台は後宮から市井、さらに隣国へと広がり、 猫猫と壬氏には新たなる試練が待</div></div></div><div class="public-list-box public-pic-b"><div class="public-list-div public-list-bj"><a target="_blank" class="public-list-exp" href="/bgmdetail/IxcDDE.html" title="冰之城墙 第二季"><img class="lazy lazy1 gen-movie-img" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="data:image/gif;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVQImWNgYGBgAAAABQABh6FO1AAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="冰之城墙 第二季" data-src="/upload/vod/20261008-1/05dd0c8b8294178112e6fc4f4c13b446.webp" /><span class="public-bg"></span><span class="public-list-prb hide ft2">更新至6集</span><span class="public-play"><i class="fa">&#xe593;</i></span></a></div><div class="public-list-button"><a target="_blank" class="time-title hide ft4 bold" href="/bgmdetail/IxcDDE.html" title="冰之城墙 第二季">冰之城墙 第二季</a><div class="public-list-subtitle cor5 hide ft2">不擅长与人接触，在自己与他人之间筑起心墙的高中生——冰川小雪。除了青梅竹马的安昙美姬外，她不与任何人来往，过着平静的日子。然而，一个不知为何拼命拉近距离的男生——雨宫凑，出现在了她的面前——？ &nb</div></div></div><div class="public-list-box public-pic-b"><div class="public-list-div public-list-bj"><a target="_blank" class="public-list-exp" href="/bgmdetail/5xcDDE.html" title="某暗部的少女共栖"><img class="lazy lazy1 gen-movie-img" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="data:image/gif;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVQImWNgYGBgAAAABQABh6FO1AAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="某暗部的少女共栖" data-src="/upload/vod/20261008-1/c048f09e4a687947ceaa4d8ebf8e1e02.webp" /><span class="public-bg"></span><span class="public-prt hide" style="background: #ffdd9a;color: #4e2d03;">本季热门</span><span class="public-list-prb hide ft2">更新至5集</span><span class="public-play"><i class="fa">&#xe593;</i></span></a></div><div class="public-list-button"><a target="_blank" class="time-title hide ft4 bold" href="/bgmdetail/5xcDDE.html" title="某暗部的少女共栖">某暗部的少女共栖</a><div class="public-list-subtitle cor5 hide ft2">位于东京西部的巨大「学园都市」。 在这座人口多达230万，其中约八成都是学生的城市，实施着为开发超能力而设计的特殊课程，学生们的能力从「无能力（Level 0）」到「超能力（Level 5）」，被划分为六个等级。 这是个拥有远远超越世间常识的科学技术，任何人都被赋予科学能力，能够安全生活，宛如梦一般的教育机构。然而，在和平的背后，却存在着承接那些绝不能公诸于世的肮脏工作的「暗部」组织。 「道具」——由四名少女组成的精锐部队。 能够自由操纵氮气、负责铁壁般防御的绢旗最爱。 运用爆裂物与陷阱，将战场玩弄于股掌</div></div></div><div class="public-list-box public-pic-b"><div class="public-list-div public-list-bj"><a target="_blank" class="public-list-exp" href="/bgmdetail/oxcDDE.html" title="我家的弟弟们真是让您费心了"><img class="lazy lazy1 gen-movie-img" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="data:image/gif;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVQImWNgYGBgAAAABQABh6FO1AAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="我家的弟弟们真是让您费心了" data-src="/upload/vod/20261008-1/d15596dd6692a6e0d6477dbdb73bcddf.webp" /><span class="public-bg"></span><span class="public-list-prb hide ft2">更新至第18集</span><span class="public-play"><i class="fa">&#xe593;</i></span></a></div><div class="public-list-button"><a target="_blank" class="time-title hide ft4 bold" href="/bgmdetail/oxcDDE.html" title="我家的弟弟们真是让您费心了">我家的弟弟们真是让您费心了</a><div class="public-list-subtitle cor5 hide ft2">高一结束的春假，糸因为母亲再婚而搬家。 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nb</div></div></div><div class="public-list-box public-pic-b"><div class="public-list-div public-list-bj"><a target="_blank" class="public-list-exp" href="/bgmdetail/IccDDE.html" title="轻松熊"><img class="lazy lazy1 gen-movie-img" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="data:image/gif;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVQImWNgYGBgAAAABQABh6FO1AAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="轻松熊" data-src="/upload/vod/20260413-1/5c4af512907205f97492babd559c5867.jpg" /><span class="public-bg"></span><span class="public-list-prb hide ft2">更新至第31集</span><span class="public-play"><i class="fa">&#xe593;</i></span></a></div><div class="public-list-button"><a target="_blank" class="time-title hide ft4 bold" href="/bgmdetail/IccDDE.html" title="轻松熊">轻松熊</a><div class="public-list-subtitle cor5 hide ft2">...</div></div></div><div class="public-list-box public-pic-b"><div class="public-list-div public-list-bj"><a target="_blank" class="public-list-exp" href="/bgmdetail/wxcDDE.html" title="提欧奥特曼"><img class="lazy lazy1 gen-movie-img" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="data:image/gif;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVQImWNgYGBgAAAABQABh6FO1AAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="提欧奥特曼" data-src="/upload/vod/20261008-1/4aa16c1cbbf496ac8999f30af8e73f5d.webp" /><span class="public-bg"></span><span class="public-list-prb hide ft2">更新至第17集</span><span class="public-play"><i class="fa">&#xe593;</i></span></a></div><div class="public-list-button"><a target="_blank" class="time-title hide ft4 bold" href="/bgmdetail/wxcDDE.html" title="提欧奥特曼">提欧奥特曼</a><div class="public-list-subtitle cor5 hide ft2">宇宙某处的行星“H12” &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nb</div></div></div><div class="public-list-box public-pic-b"><div class="public-list-div public-list-bj"><a target="_blank" class="public-list-exp" href="/bgmdetail/5WcDDE.html" title="朱色的面具"><img class="lazy lazy1 gen-movie-img" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="data:image/gif;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVQImWNgYGBgAAAABQABh6FO1AAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="朱色的面具" data-src="/upload/vod/20261018-1/a6b7113deb240f959e491265847c981c.webp" /><span class="public-bg"></span><span class="public-list-prb hide ft2">更新至第05集</span><span class="public-play"><i class="fa">&#xe593;</i></span></a></div><div class="public-list-button"><a target="_blank" class="time-title hide ft4 bold" href="/bgmdetail/5WcDDE.html" title="朱色的面具">朱色的面具</a><div class="public-list-subtitle cor5 hide ft2">奋起反抗吧！迎战强敌——抗争命运—— &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbs</div></div></div><div class="public-list-box public-pic-b"><div class="public-list-div public-list-bj"><a target="_blank" class="public-list-exp" href="/bgmdetail/bDDDDE.html" title="名侦探柯南"><img class="lazy lazy1 gen-movie-img" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="data:image/gif;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVQImWNgYGBgAAAABQABh6FO1AAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="名侦探柯南" data-src="/upload/vod/20240627-1/6be4d5868c4ca60e45cf1bffd03151cf.jpg" /><span class="public-bg"></span><span class="public-list-prb hide ft2">更新至第1279集</span><span class="public-play"><i class="fa">&#xe593;</i></span></a></div><div class="public-list-button"><a target="_blank" class="time-title hide ft4 bold" href="/bgmdetail/bDDDDE.html" title="名侦探柯南">名侦探柯南</a><div class="public-list-subtitle cor5 hide ft2">　　工藤新一是全国著名的高中生侦探，在一次追查黑衣人犯罪团伙时不幸被团伙成员发现，击晕后喂了神奇的药水，工藤新一变回了小孩！新一找到了经常帮助他的阿笠博士，博士为他度身打造不少间谍武器。为了防止犯罪团</div></div></div><div class="public-list-box public-pic-b"><div class="public-list-div public-list-bj"><a target="_blank" class="public-list-exp" href="/bgmdetail/6xcDDE.html" title="转生了的大圣女，拼死隐瞒自己身为圣女"><img class="lazy lazy1 gen-movie-img" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="data:image/gif;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVQImWNgYGBgAAAABQABh6FO1AAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="转生了的大圣女，拼死隐瞒自己身为圣女" data-src="/upload/vod/20261008-1/7c21d454970bad0d58090adbcf8d7888.webp" /><span class="public-bg"></span><span class="public-list-prb hide ft2">更新至第07集</span><span class="public-play"><i class="fa">&#xe593;</i></span></a></div><div class="public-list-button"><a target="_blank" class="time-title hide ft4 bold" href="/bgmdetail/6xcDDE.html" title="转生了的大圣女，拼死隐瞒自己身为圣女">转生了的大圣女，拼死隐瞒自己身为圣女</a><div class="public-list-subtitle cor5 hide ft2">被认为「没有使剑的才能」的骑士家的少女·菲亚。她在濒死之际，回想起自己前世是拥有规格外能力的「大圣女」，并且使最强的魔物·黑龙成为她的从魔。但是回想起在前世魔王的右腕曾威胁她说「若是依旧作为圣女转生那</div></div></div><div class="public-list-box public-pic-b"><div class="public-list-div public-list-bj"><a target="_blank" class="public-list-exp" href="/bgmdetail/gxcDDE.html" title="罗梅莉亚战记"><img class="lazy lazy1 gen-movie-img" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="data:image/gif;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVQImWNgYGBgAAAABQABh6FO1AAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="罗梅莉亚战记" data-src="/upload/vod/20261008-1/b3dd192b139b62961f41eabef9e814d5.webp" /><span class="public-bg"></span><span class="public-list-prb hide ft2">更新至第06集</span><span class="public-play"><i class="fa">&#xe593;</i></span></a></div><div class="public-list-button"><a target="_blank" class="time-title hide ft4 bold" href="/bgmdetail/gxcDDE.html" title="罗梅莉亚战记">罗梅莉亚战记</a><div class="public-list-subtitle cor5 hide ft2">#罗梅莉亚战记# 动画化官宣</div></div></div><div class="public-list-box public-pic-b"><div class="public-list-div public-list-bj"><a target="_blank" class="public-list-exp" href="/bgmdetail/GxcDDE.html" title="野生的大魔王出现了！第二季"><img class="lazy lazy1 gen-movie-img" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="data:image/gif;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVQImWNgYGBgAAAABQABh6FO1AAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="野生的大魔王出现了！第二季" data-src="/upload/vod/20261008-1/508d72f1a0c925d2e3b19b48916c0e68.webp" /><span class="public-bg"></span><span class="public-list-prb hide ft2">更新至第07集</span><span class="public-play"><i class="fa">&#xe593;</i></span></a></div><div class="public-list-button"><a target="_blank" class="time-title hide ft4 bold" href="/bgmdetail/GxcDDE.html" title="野生的大魔王出现了！第二季">野生的大魔王出现了！第二季</a><div class="public-list-subtitle cor5 hide ft2">...</div></div></div><div class="public-list-box public-pic-b"><div class="public-list-div public-list-bj"><a target="_blank" class="public-list-exp" href="/bgmdetail/fxcDDE.html" title="顶点武装"><img class="lazy lazy1 gen-movie-img" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="data:image/gif;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVQImWNgYGBgAAAABQABh6FO1AAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="顶点武装" data-src="/upload/vod/20261008-1/e650f3d465512ec8bcfd56f8e741d789.webp" /><span class="public-bg"></span><span class="public-list-prb hide ft2">更新至第06集</span><span class="public-play"><i class="fa">&#xe593;</i></span></a></div><div class="public-list-button"><a target="_blank" class="time-title hide ft4 bold" href="/bgmdetail/fxcDDE.html" title="顶点武装">顶点武装</a><div class="public-list-subtitle cor5 hide ft2">居住在冲绳北部的中学生东道明，与姐姐晴香以及经营咖啡店的母亲，一家三口过着平静的日常生活。 然而，这个家庭却隐藏着一个秘密。 晴香继承了父亲被称为“引擎”的力量，并一直向外人隐瞒着这份力量生活着。 另一方面，没能继承父亲力量的明，对自己的弱小感到自卑。 就在这时，世界各地开始发生异变。 逼近明等人的神秘敌人，究竟有何目的——。 背负宇宙命运的少年少女们的战斗，此刻打响。</div></div></div><div class="public-list-box public-pic-b"><div class="public-list-div public-list-bj"><a target="_blank" class="public-list-exp" href="/bgmdetail/J8EDDE.html" title="新宝可梦"><img class="lazy lazy1 gen-movie-img" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="data:image/gif;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVQImWNgYGBgAAAABQABh6FO1AAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="新宝可梦" data-src="/upload/vod/20240713-1/ae285f5b70fbfa0b013c79c5f5666976.jpg" /><span class="public-bg"></span><span class="public-list-prb hide ft2">更新至第156集</span><span class="public-play"><i class="fa">&#xe593;</i></span></a></div><div class="public-list-button"><a target="_blank" class="time-title hide ft4 bold" href="/bgmdetail/J8EDDE.html" title="新宝可梦">新宝可梦</a><div class="public-list-subtitle cor5 hide ft2">　　与莉可、罗伊以及帕底亚地区的三只最初的宝可梦们一起踏上激动人心的宝可梦世界冒险之旅吧！</div></div></div><div class="public-list-box public-pic-b"><div class="public-list-div public-list-bj"><a target="_blank" class="public-list-exp" href="/bgmdetail/78EDDE.html" title="名侦探柯南日语版"><img class="lazy lazy1 gen-movie-img" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="data:image/gif;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVQImWNgYGBgAAAABQABh6FO1AAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="名侦探柯南日语版" data-src="/upload/vod/20240720-1/8264622ee65b8a6e8153e853326b51ec.jpg" /><span class="public-bg"></span><span class="public-list-prb hide ft2">更新至第1279集</span><span class="public-play"><i class="fa">&#xe593;</i></span></a></div><div class="public-list-button"><a target="_blank" class="time-title hide ft4 bold" href="/bgmdetail/78EDDE.html" title="名侦探柯南日语版">名侦探柯南日语版</a><div class="public-list-subtitle cor5 hide ft2">工藤新一是全国著名的高中生侦探，在一次追查黑衣人犯罪团伙时不幸被团伙成员发现，击晕后喂了神奇的药水，工藤新一变回了小孩！新一找到了经常帮助他的阿笠博士，博士为他度身打造不少间谍武器。为了防止犯罪团伙对</div></div></div><div class="public-list-box public-pic-b"><div class="public-list-div public-list-bj"><a target="_blank" class="public-list-exp" href="/bgmdetail/UxcDDE.html" title="名侦探柯南国语"><img class="lazy lazy1 gen-movie-img" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="data:image/gif;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVQImWNgYGBgAAAABQABh6FO1AAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="名侦探柯南国语" data-src="/upload/vod/20261008-1/5250c602661b82bf0090084cc7e69be2.jpg" /><span class="public-bg"></span><span class="public-list-prb hide ft2">更新至第1279集</span><span class="public-play"><i class="fa">&#xe593;</i></span></a></div><div class="public-list-button"><a target="_blank" class="time-title hide ft4 bold" href="/bgmdetail/UxcDDE.html" title="名侦探柯南国语">名侦探柯南国语</a><div class="public-list-subtitle cor5 hide ft2">工藤新一是全国著名的高中生侦探，在一次追查黑衣人犯罪团伙时不幸被团伙成员发现，击晕后喂了神奇的药水，工藤新一变回了小孩！新一找到了经常帮助他的阿笠博士，博士为他度身打造不少间谍武器。为了防止犯罪团</div></div></div><div class="public-list-box public-pic-b"><div class="public-list-div public-list-bj"><a target="_blank" class="public-list-exp" href="/bgmdetail/zxcDDE.html" title="东京复仇者 三天战争篇"><img class="lazy lazy1 gen-movie-img" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="data:image/gif;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVQImWNgYGBgAAAABQABh6FO1AAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" alt="东京复仇者 三天战争篇" data-src="/upload/vod/20261008-1/82e0ae0147a334eb41b219b747b16ac6.jpg" /><span class="public-bg"></span><span class="public-list-prb hide ft2">更新至第6集</span><span class="public-play"><i class="fa">&#xe593;</i></span></a></div><div class="public-list-button"><a target="_blank" class="time-title hide ft4 bold" href="/bgmdetail/zxcDDE.html" title="东京复仇者 三天战争篇">东京复仇者 三天战争篇</a><div class="public-list-subtitle cor5 hide ft2">东京卍会与天竺的抗争以惨烈的结局落下帷幕。 在众人各自怀抱着悲伤走向未来之时， 花垣武道对已死的稀咲铁太感到了敬畏。 接着，听说了整个时空穿越经过的佐野万次郎做出了某个决定。 结束战斗、告别过去的花垣武道，终于抵达了恋人橘日向依然存活的最佳未来。 然而，在那里，却不见“他”的身影。 三支队伍争夺霸权—— 在这个被称为 “三天时代” 的世界里， 最后的复仇，就此开始！</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="info-parameter none"><div style="overflow-y:auto;padding:15px;width:100%;height:100%"><div class="wap-head bj4"><div class="l"><a class="fa drawer-of cor4" href="javascript:">&#xe566;</a></div><h2 class="hidden"><a class="cor4 b" href="javascript:">影片参数</a></h2></div><div class="wap-head-z"></div><div class="gen-search-form search-show drawer-scroll-list cor5" style="line-height:30px"><ul><li><em class="cor4">片名：</em><span>尼古喵喵</span></li><li><em class="cor4">状态：</em><span>更新至7集</span></li><li class="partition"><em class="cor4">主演：</em>未知</li><li class="partition"><em class="cor4">导演：</em><a href="/bgmsearch/-----%E6%9C%A8%E6%9D%91%E6%8B%93--------.html" target="_blank">木村拓</a><span class="n cor5">,</span></li><li><em class="cor4">年份：</em>2026</li><li><em class="cor4">地区：</em>日本</li><li><em class="cor4">类型：</em><a href="/bgmsearch/----%E5%8A%A8%E6%BC%AB---------.html" target="_blank">动漫</a>&nbsp;<a href="/bgmsearch/----%E7%95%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%BC%AB---------.html" target="_blank">番动漫</a>&nbsp;<a href="/bgmsearch/----%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%A9%E5%8A%A8%E6%BC%AB---------.html" target="_blank">日韩动漫</a>&nbsp;</li><li><em class="cor4">频道：</em>内详</li><li><em class="cor4">上映：</em>未知</li><li><em class="cor4">语言：</em>日语</li><li><em class="cor4">更新：</em>2026-10-18 00:53</li><li class="top26"><em class="cor4">简介：</em>暂无简介</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="footer top40 wap-hide"><div class="footer-bottom"><div class="box-width flex between"><div class="hoa">&copy;&nbsp;2026&nbsp;<a href="/">www.akianime.com</a>&nbsp;All rights reservd.</div><div class="footer-a-url hoa"><a href="/gbook.html" target="_blank">问题反馈</a><a href="/rss/baidu.xml" target="_blan